  "content": "```lean\ntheorem putnam_1964_a4\n(u : ℕ → ℤ)\n(boundedu : ∃ B T : ℤ, ∀ n : ℕ, B ≤ u n ∧ u n ≤ T)\n(hu : ∀ n ≥ 4, u n = ((u (n - 1) + u (n - 2) + u (n - 3) * u (n - 4)) : ℝ) / (u (n - 1) * u (n - 2) + u (n - 3) + u (n - 4)) ∧ (u (n - 1) * u (n - 2) + u (n - 3) + u (n - 4)) ≠ 0)\n: (∃ N c : ℕ, c > 0 ∧ ∀ n ≥ N, u (n + c) = u n) := by\n  obtain ⟨B, T, hB⟩ := boundedu\n  let v n : Set.Icc B T := ⟨u n, hB n⟩\n  let f n := (v n, v (n + 1), v (n + 2), v (n + 3))\n  obtain ⟨i, j, hij, he⟩ := Set.finite_univ.exists_lt_map_eq_of_forall_mem\n    (f := f) (by simp)\n  replace hu n := (hu _ (Nat.le_add_left 4 n)).1\n  refine ⟨i, j - i, Nat.sub_pos_of_lt hij, ?_⟩\n  intro n hn\n  suffices f n = f (n + (j - i)) from congrArg (·.1.val) this.symm\n  induction hn\n  · rwa [Nat.add_sub_of_le hij.le]\n  · clear he\n    simp_all +zetaDelta only [Prod.mk.injEq, Subtype.mk.injEq, true_and,\n      ← @Int.cast_inj ℝ, Nat.reduceSubDiff, Nat.succ_add]\n```",
